      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Owner goal → planner interpretation → persona or custom style.\nEvery checkpoint description + kind, URL marker and text marker.\nplan_done marks completed items and selects the current item.\nRules for evidence, current IDs, scroll/wait, visitor mode and forms.\nSynthetic identity derived from run_id. Page content is untrusted.\nPrior model turns and prior screenshots are absent.",
      "originalText": "Owner goal → planner interpretation → persona or custom style.\nEvery checkpoint description + kind, URL marker and text marker.\nplan_done marks completed items and selects the current item.\nRules for evidence, current IDs, scroll/wait, visitor mode and forms.\nSynthetic identity derived from run_id. Page content is untrusted.\nPrior model turns and prior screenshots are absent.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
