      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Starts with code-confirmed milestone proofs from the step log.\nThen up to 4 older unresolved actions and the most recent 8 steps.\nRecent rows: action, target ID, origin/result URL, scroll or wait\nsettings, visible no-change, executor result, errors, notices, notes,\nstop code and interruption. Overall history is capped at 6,000 chars.\nEarlier target labels, revisions, thoughts and typed values are absent.\nOlder failures retain a smaller subset. Diagnostics and frames stay out.",
      "originalText": "Starts with code-confirmed milestone proofs from the step log.\nThen up to 4 older unresolved actions and the most recent 8 steps.\nRecent rows: action, target ID, origin/result URL, scroll or wait\nsettings, visible no-change, executor result, errors, notices, notes,\nstop code and interruption. Overall history is capped at 6,000 chars.\nEarlier target labels, revisions, thoughts and typed values are absent.\nOlder failures retain a smaller subset. Diagnostics and frames stay out.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
