      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Current URL/title, error and success notices, executor note/result.\nScroll position, v3 container IDs/geometry and coverage flags.\nCurrent element ID, tag/type/label, fill state, row/region, visibility.\nFirst 4,000 chars of page text. No image input or earlier DOM snapshots.\nExecutor revision is held in state and stamped on the action by code.",
      "originalText": "Current URL/title, error and success notices, executor note/result.\nScroll position, v3 container IDs/geometry and coverage flags.\nCurrent element ID, tag/type/label, fill state, row/region, visibility.\nFirst 4,000 chars of page text. No image input or earlier DOM snapshots.\nExecutor revision is held in state and stamped on the action by code.",
      "textAlign": "left",
