      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "decide.ask() calls model.decide(state, messages) or model.invoke().\nDefault LLM gets the two messages. CandidateController uses them too.\nPersonaStep: thought, action, target_id, text, confusion and progress,\nplus bounded scroll/wait fields. Actions: click, type, scroll, wait,\nback, done or give_up. Code overwrites progress with plan_done.\nOne corrective call for unproved done or give_up without a site block.",
      "originalText": "decide.ask() calls model.decide(state, messages) or model.invoke().\nDefault LLM gets the two messages. CandidateController uses them too.\nPersonaStep: thought, action, target_id, text, confusion and progress,\nplus bounded scroll/wait fields. Actions: click, type, scroll, wait,\nback, done or give_up. Code overwrites progress with plan_done.\nOne corrective call for unproved done or give_up without a site block.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
