      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "build_request() sends goal, checklist, confirmed count and proof list,\npersona, login flag, latest validated observation and 12 compact steps.\nSelects among current visible targets and bounded operations.\nConfidence, invalid choice or open-ended value can trigger LLM fallback.\nThe result goes through the same safety and completion code.",
      "originalText": "build_request() sends goal, checklist, confirmed count and proof list,\npersona, login flag, latest validated observation and 12 compact steps.\nSelects among current visible targets and bounded operations.\nConfidence, invalid choice or open-ended value can trigger LLM fallback.\nThe result goes through the same safety and completion code.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
