      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Old target #1 can mean Pricing while current #1 means Home.\ntarget_label is recorded, but history prints only the number.\nThe model sees a route change and current page. It gets no reason\nthat the verifier refused a checkpoint or skipped later ones.\nThe previous Observation is overwritten. Only extracted facts survive.\nLong feeds can omit controls; text starts at the top of the document.\nNo explicit attempts remaining, prior control context, or semantic delta\nfor selected state, row changes or newly filled fields in the LLM input.",
      "originalText": "Old target #1 can mean Pricing while current #1 means Home.\ntarget_label is recorded, but history prints only the number.\nThe model sees a route change and current page. It gets no reason\nthat the verifier refused a checkpoint or skipped later ones.\nThe previous Observation is overwritten. Only extracted facts survive.\nLong feeds can omit controls; text starts at the top of the document.\nNo explicit attempts remaining, prior control context, or semantic delta\nfor selected state, row changes or newly filled fields in the LLM input.",
      "textAlign": "left",
