      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Modern scroll/wait needs v3 + revision; scrolling\nalso needs a usable pane. Missing click/type ID →\nlegacy scroll. Occluded/offscreen target → agent_lost.\nEmpty typing can use the synthetic identity. Visitor mode\nlimits form entry, social and commerce. Destructive\ncontrols stop the run. Verified sends are marked once;\nbrowser approval is required. Cloud refuses sends.",
      "originalText": "Modern scroll/wait needs v3 + revision; scrolling\nalso needs a usable pane. Missing click/type ID →\nlegacy scroll. Occluded/offscreen target → agent_lost.\nEmpty typing can use the synthetic identity. Visitor mode\nlimits form entry, social and commerce. Destructive\ncontrols stop the run. Verified sends are marked once;\nbrowser approval is required. Cloud refuses sends.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
