      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Legacy direct payload updates only observation.\nStale target flags interruption and suppresses outcomes.\nMerge result_url, error/notice/note, new errors and\nmatching scroll/wait result. Unchanged clean click is\nno_change. Keep optional diagnostics/frame metadata.\nReplace observation after comparing before/after.",
      "originalText": "Legacy direct payload updates only observation.\nStale target flags interruption and suppresses outcomes.\nMerge result_url, error/notice/note, new errors and\nmatching scroll/wait result. Unchanged clean click is\nno_change. Keep optional diagnostics/frame metadata.\nReplace observation after comparing before/after.",
