      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Eligible click/type/back/wait; same origin; no errors or note.\nNavigation: declared route newly reached. Host, '/', or\nstart route alone cannot establish it. Outcome: fresh positive\ndeclared public phrase, plus URL scope if supplied.\nScroll, stable UI and generic toasts alone give no proof.\nWait: only eligible after an earlier recorded click/type and\nchanged/settled result. Stop at first missing or duplicate proof.\nassertions.evaluate() reads a declared synthetic count separately.",
      "originalText": "Eligible click/type/back/wait; same origin; no errors or note.\nNavigation: declared route newly reached. Host, '/', or\nstart route alone cannot establish it. Outcome: fresh positive\ndeclared public phrase, plus URL scope if supplied.\nScroll, stable UI and generic toasts alone give no proof.\nWait: only eligible after an earlier recorded click/type and\nchanged/settled result. Stop at first missing or duplicate proof.\nassertions.evaluate() reads a declared synthetic count separately.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
