      "text": "_confirmed() checks count and proof list. _site_block() ties\na new visible error to the latest actual click/type.\n_observation_stop() reads browser boundary notes.\n_lost() detects missing targets; _page() normalizes visits.\n_identity_value() and _visitor_stop() support enforcement.",
