      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "1  Stale target / agent_lost code\n2  Safe stop, bot wall or CAPTCHA code\n3  done needs proof; give_up is\n    gave_up only for an observed site block\n4  Browser boundary note / aborted action\n5  All proofs → done. Step cap → budget\n6  Repeated rejected typing → stuck\n7  3 timeouts/no-progress → agent_lost\n8  3 identical steps → stuck or agent_lost;\n    actual pane/list movement can continue\n9  Third page visit → looping\n10 Otherwise running\n\nPOST /stop records stopped outside graph.",
      "originalText": "1  Stale target / agent_lost code\n2  Safe stop, bot wall or CAPTCHA code\n3  done needs proof; give_up is\n    gave_up only for an observed site block\n4  Browser boundary note / aborted action\n5  All proofs → done. Step cap → budget\n6  Repeated rejected typing → stuck\n7  3 timeouts/no-progress → agent_lost\n8  3 identical steps → stuck or agent_lost;\n    actual pane/list movement can continue\n9  Third page visit → looping\n10 Otherwise running\n\nPOST /stop records stopped outside graph.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
