      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "runTest → activeTab / ensureContentScript → snapshot / humanCheck.\nlib/api: startRun, observe and stopRun over authenticated HTTP.\nact: revision/origin checks, dry run and owner confirmation when required.\ninject → execute / executeAsync → resolveTarget / resolveScrollContainer.\nSettle, re-snapshot and attach browser diagnostics. Best-effort masked\nJPEGs go to private Supabase Storage via captureStepEvidence.",
      "originalText": "runTest → activeTab / ensureContentScript → snapshot / humanCheck.\nlib/api: startRun, observe and stopRun over authenticated HTTP.\nact: revision/origin checks, dry run and owner confirmation when required.\ninject → execute / executeAsync → resolveTarget / resolveScrollContainer.\nSettle, re-snapshot and attach browser diagnostics. Best-effort masked\nJPEGs go to private Supabase Storage via captureStepEvidence.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
