      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Start/watch/stop routes and cloud_runs rows. work_one claims and renews\nthe lease; journey.run drives a throwaway headless Chromium via CDP.\nguard.install checks public addresses; cdp.read waits for a stable page.\nReuses built inject.js; calls _start_run / _observe / _stop_run directly.\nFresh unsigned session, no real sends; captures landing/aim/outcome frames.\nWeb live card polls queue/run state. SessionPlayer replays saved evidence.",
      "originalText": "Start/watch/stop routes and cloud_runs rows. work_one claims and renews\nthe lease; journey.run drives a throwaway headless Chromium via CDP.\nguard.install checks public addresses; cdp.read waits for a stable page.\nReuses built inject.js; calls _start_run / _observe / _stop_run directly.\nFresh unsigned session, no real sends; captures landing/aim/outcome frames.\nWeb live card polls queue/run state. SessionPlayer replays saved evidence.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
