      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Auth/session, idempotent start, entitlements, _persona and _group.\nOptional accepted quote pins terms. Parallel domain ownership verification.\nAbuse/policy checks gate site, goal and visitor/owner mode. Optional\nreservation precedes goal.plan (fast model, literal fallback) or the\ndeterministic count mission. Planner refusal → 422. Otherwise insert run,\noptionally share with team and audit. Seed observation, first_text, start_url,\nempty steps and plan_done = 0. runtime.invoke → _reply.",
      "originalText": "Auth/session, idempotent start, entitlements, _persona and _group.\nOptional accepted quote pins terms. Parallel domain ownership verification.\nAbuse/policy checks gate site, goal and visitor/owner mode. Optional\nreservation precedes goal.plan (fast model, literal fallback) or the\ndeterministic count mission. Planner refusal → 422. Otherwise insert run,\noptionally share with team and audit. Seed observation, first_text, start_url,\nempty steps and plan_done = 0. runtime.invoke → _reply.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
