      "seed": 75152,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 11536,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Identity/policy: run_id, site, goal, persona, persona_prompt,\nlogged_in, verified, mode, max_steps.\nBrowser: observation, first_text, start_url, steps.\nProgress: status, tokens, plan, plan_done, checkpoint_evidence,\nassertion, assertion_outcome. Nodes return partial state updates.\nruntime.graph(tier) caches compiled graphs and shares a checkpointer.\nthread_id = run_id. MemorySaver is the local default. PostgresSaver\npersists checkpoints, pending tasks and resume state across restarts\nand is required in production. This is per-run working memory.",
      "originalText": "Identity/policy: run_id, site, goal, persona, persona_prompt,\nlogged_in, verified, mode, max_steps.\nBrowser: observation, first_text, start_url, steps.\nProgress: status, tokens, plan, plan_done, checkpoint_evidence,\nassertion, assertion_outcome. Nodes return partial state updates.\nruntime.graph(tier) caches compiled graphs and shares a checkpointer.\nthread_id = run_id. MemorySaver is the local default. PostgresSaver\npersists checkpoints, pending tasks and resume state across restarts\nand is required in production. This is per-run working memory.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "services-stores",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 2580,
