      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Supabase Data API: runs row, audit, jobs, entitlements, usage and queue.\nRuns hold steps/report for UI and replay; they cannot resume the graph.\nStorage: private run-evidence JPEGs and signed access for report/replay.\nController/planner free route: Groq configured order → Gemini. Report\ncalls can add OpenRouter after the first Groq model. Structured output,\nprovider guard, fallbacks and optional provider usage receipts.\nOptional Jev, Haiku or paid controller candidates are config-dependent.\nRetention removes evidence → checkpoint thread → run; evidence TTL is\nseparate from the run lifetime.",
      "originalText": "Supabase Data API: runs row, audit, jobs, entitlements, usage and queue.\nRuns hold steps/report for UI and replay; they cannot resume the graph.\nStorage: private run-evidence JPEGs and signed access for report/replay.\nController/planner free route: Groq configured order → Gemini. Report\ncalls can add OpenRouter after the first Groq model. Structured output,\nprovider guard, fallbacks and optional provider usage receipts.\nOptional Jev, Haiku or paid controller candidates are config-dependent.\nRetention removes evidence → checkpoint thread → run; evidence TTL is\nseparate from the run lifetime.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
