      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Add a deterministic normalization pass in goal.plan before graph start.\nDrop only a redundant, start-only navigation precondition when a later\ncheckpoint still represents the objective. Catch host-only/root markers\nand already-satisfied setup routes. Preserve real ordered user milestones.\nIf the whole goal is to open the page already on screen, record a distinct\ninitial navigation observation or ask for clarification if the target is unclear.\nRequire a concrete finish condition for functional goals. Ask for the exact\nvisible result when unknown. A route can prove navigation only.\nRegression: the same pricing click finishes with the validated plan.",
      "originalText": "Add a deterministic normalization pass in goal.plan before graph start.\nDrop only a redundant, start-only navigation precondition when a later\ncheckpoint still represents the objective. Catch host-only/root markers\nand already-satisfied setup routes. Preserve real ordered user milestones.\nIf the whole goal is to open the page already on screen, record a distinct\ninitial navigation observation or ask for clarification if the target is unclear.\nRequire a concrete finish condition for functional goals. Ask for the exact\nvisible result when unknown. A route can prove navigation only.\nRegression: the same pricing click finishes with the validated plan.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
