      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Have act/check emit a bounded, code-owned assessment for the active\nmilestone and the observed transition. Keep a matched proof or a reason:\ninvalid marker, wrong route, missing phrase, pre-existing phrase,\ncontradictory UI, observed refusal, or insufficient coverage.\nPut that reason beside the current checkpoint in the next prompt.\nRetain ordered proof. Keep completion unconfirmed when proof is missing.\nExpose the reason separately from target loss and actual site errors in\nthe report and live UI. One model retry cannot repair a broken plan.",
      "originalText": "Have act/check emit a bounded, code-owned assessment for the active\nmilestone and the observed transition. Keep a matched proof or a reason:\ninvalid marker, wrong route, missing phrase, pre-existing phrase,\ncontradictory UI, observed refusal, or insufficient coverage.\nPut that reason beside the current checkpoint in the next prompt.\nRetain ordered proof. Keep completion unconfirmed when proof is missing.\nExpose the reason separately from target loss and actual site errors in\nthe report and live UI. One model retry cannot repair a broken plan.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
