      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Include prior action label, role, region/row, source revision, and the\nobserved outcome. Mark historical IDs as unusable on the current page.\nAdd a bounded before/after delta for route, alerts, selection and fill\nstate when observed. Prioritize viewport and active dialog text.\nExpose step budget and snapshot coverage. Keep privacy masking and\ncurrent-revision enforcement. Keep the full audit log for reports.",
      "originalText": "Include prior action label, role, region/row, source revision, and the\nobserved outcome. Mark historical IDs as unusable on the current page.\nAdd a bounded before/after delta for route, alerts, selection and fill\nstate when observed. Prioritize viewport and active dialog text.\nExpose step budget and snapshot coverage. Keep privacy masking and\ncurrent-revision enforcement. Keep the full audit log for reports.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
