      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Track invalid target/action choices, repeated actions, unprovable plans,\nfailed proof matching, actual site blocks and false success separately.\nReplay prompts and observations, then rerun held-out tasks in a browser.\nInclude navigation, same-route outcomes, delayed confirmation, duplicate\nlabels and successful controls with missing proof as a negative case.\nCompare models only after holding the planner and proof rules fixed.",
      "originalText": "Track invalid target/action choices, repeated actions, unprovable plans,\nfailed proof matching, actual site blocks and false success separately.\nReplay prompts and observations, then rerun held-out tasks in a browser.\nInclude navigation, same-route outcomes, delayed confirmation, duplicate\nlabels and successful controls with missing proof as a negative case.\nCompare models only after holding the planner and proof rules fixed.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
