      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Goal + initial snapshot  →  validated plan  →  active checkpoint + proof status  →  model action  →  browser\nBrowser observation  →  ordered proof check + outcome delta  →  next prompt with semantic history and verifier reason\n\nAcceptance gate: the pricing fixture finishes after one click. Missing functional proof stays unconfirmed.\nMeasure how often planning, observation, model choice, execution and verification cause failures on held-out runs.",
      "originalText": "Goal + initial snapshot  →  validated plan  →  active checkpoint + proof status  →  model action  →  browser\nBrowser observation  →  ordered proof check + outcome delta  →  next prompt with semantic history and verifier reason\n\nAcceptance gate: the pricing fixture finishes after one click. Missing functional proof stays unconfirmed.\nMeasure how often planning, observation, model choice, execution and verification cause failures on held-out runs.",
