      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "_finish_later enqueues report:{run_id}. Job payload keeps status, steps, tokens, first_text, plan and final observed elements.\nWorker claims with a lease, checks for an existing report, retries with backoff. main.finish_run re-reads row and verification, then calls report.run_report().",
      "originalText": "_finish_later enqueues report:{run_id}. Job payload keeps status, steps, tokens, first_text, plan and final observed elements.\nWorker claims with a lease, checks for an existing report, retries with backoff. main.finish_run re-reads row and verification, then calls report.run_report().",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
