      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "ReportState reducers add notes and token counts. synthesis_inputs merges scans, mailer signals, browser_findings, step outcomes\nand final controls. problem_steps and grounded_ux constrain model findings to recorded failures. An unfinished journey with no\nobserved failure uses a deterministic summary. build_assessment creates evidence and coverage. score computes readiness.\nOptional count context is read by the report contract. Current queue payload omits assertion and assertion_outcome.",
      "originalText": "ReportState reducers add notes and token counts. synthesis_inputs merges scans, mailer signals, browser_findings, step outcomes\nand final controls. problem_steps and grounded_ux constrain model findings to recorded failures. An unfinished journey with no\nobserved failure uses a deterministic summary. build_assessment creates evidence and coverage. score computes readiness.\nOptional count context is read by the report contract. Current queue payload omits assertion and assertion_outcome.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
