      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "finish_run adds decision tokens, compare.attach links previous runs, and paid funnel.metrics adds journey metrics. db.set_report persists v2.\nnotify.report_ready plus optional Resend email. The job settles eligible reservations after a report exists. Web/report exports and fix prompts use saved evidence.",
      "originalText": "finish_run adds decision tokens, compare.attach links previous runs, and paid funnel.metrics adds journey metrics. db.set_report persists v2.\nnotify.report_ready plus optional Resend email. The job settles eligible reservations after a report exists. Web/report exports and fix prompts use saved evidence.",
